    {
      "_id": "6af336dd12fd78f09cb500c1",
      "title": "허리 통증의 원인은 무엇일까요? 스트레스부터 바른 자세까지, 의외의 유발 요인과 해결 방법은 무엇일까요?",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/VIU0clb7VJE/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"허리 통증의 원인은 무엇일까요? 스트레스부터 바른 자세까지, 의외의 유발 요인과 해결 방법은 무엇일까요?\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">허리 통증의 원인은 무엇일까요? 스트레스부터 바른 자세까지, 의외의 유발 요인과 해결 방법은 무엇일까요? 주제를 다룬 The Guardian 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\"><mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">Disc bulges</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Disc bulges and joint wear can all show up in people with no pain at all.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> and joint wear can all show up in people with no pain at all.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">디스크 돌출과 관절 마모는 통증이 전혀 없는 사람에게서도 나타날 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. disc bulge: 디스크 돌출</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">A <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">twinge</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"A twinge isn’t a sign of damage.\" aria-label=\"A twinge isn’t a sign of damage. 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> isn’t a sign of damage.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">순간적으로 찌릿한 통증이 반드시 신체 손상을 의미하지는 않는다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. twinge: 찌릿한 통증, 순간적 통증</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Both extremes – too active or too <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">sedentary</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Both extremes – too active or too sedentary – can cause back pain.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> – can cause back pain.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">너무 활동적이거나 너무 앉아 있기만 해도 허리 통증이 날 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. sedentary: 오래 앉아 있는, 좌식의</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">An MRI can seem like a route to getting answers, but in most cases findings don’t <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">correlate</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"An MRI can seem like a route to getting answers, but in most cases findings don’t correlate with the degree of pain felt, Bush says.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> with the degree of pain felt, Bush says.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">MRI가 해답을 찾는 방법처럼 보일 수 있지만, 대부분의 경우 검사 소견은 통증 정도와 상관관계가 없다고 부시는 말한다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. correlate: 상관관계를 갖다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Back pain is a part of the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">undulating</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Back pain is a part of the undulating highway of being a human being.\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> highway of being a human being.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">허리 통증은 인간으로 살아가는 기복 있는 여정의 일부다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. undulating: 올라갔다 내려갔다 하는</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">Stress essentially turns up the volume of pain.<button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"Stress essentially turns up the volume of pain.\" aria-label=\"Stress essentially turns up the volume of pain. 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button></p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">스트레스는 본질적으로 통증의 강도를 높인다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. turn up: (볼륨·강도 등을) 높이다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIU0clb7VJE\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Guardian | What causes back pain? The surprising triggers, from stress to sitting up straight – and what you can do about it | By Éva Malpass</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2026/nov/06/experts-why-your-back-hurts-and-what-to-do-about-it\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
      "slug": "disc-bulge-twinge-sedentary-correlate-undulating-related-words",
      "metaDescription": "The Guardian 기사에서 추출한 시사 영단어. disc bulge, twinge, sedentary, correlate, undulating, turn up 등.",
      "date": "2026-11-09",
