    {
      "_id": "6af3399c12fd78f09cb50150",
      "title": "기억력을 향상시키는 방법",
      "message": "<article class=\"nv-text\">\n<p class=\"nv-cover\"><img class=\"nv-cover-img\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/bIKxLCK2Tso/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"기억력을 향상시키는 방법\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\"></p>\n<div class=\"nv-lead\">\n<p class=\"nv-lead-text\">기억력을 향상시키는 방법 주제를 다룬 The Guardian 기사에서 주요 시사 영단어를 정리합니다. *AI 음성과 이미지를 사용했습니다.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"nv-body\">\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Memory is a <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">buildable</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;Memory is a buildable skill. You can train it, just like learning how to ride a bike or drive.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> skill. You can train it, just like learning how to ride a bike or drive.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">기억력은 훈련으로 키울 수 있는 능력이다. 자전거 타기나 운전을 배우듯 기억력도 훈련할 수 있다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. buildable: 키울 수 있는, 발전시킬 수 있는</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;But the times we are living in are not <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">conducive to</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;But the times we are living in are not conducive to maintaining a strong memory.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> maintaining a strong memory.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">하지만 우리가 살아가는 시대는 좋은 기억력을 유지하는 데 도움이 되지 않는다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. conducive to: ~에 도움이 되는, 유리한</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;I couldn’t remember my pin because my brain was <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">frazzled</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;I couldn’t remember my pin because my brain was frazzled.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">머리가 완전히 지쳐 있어서 비밀번호를 기억할 수 없었다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. frazzled: 기진맥진한, 정신적으로 지친</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Even having a mobile phone that was off next to you acts as a <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">distractor</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;Even having a mobile phone that was off next to you acts as a distractor of your attention.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> of your attention.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">전원이 꺼진 휴대전화를 옆에 두는 것만으로도 주의를 분산시키는 요인이 된다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. distractor: 주의를 흩뜨리는 것, 주의 분산 요인</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Therefore, it is important to sleep well and not to stay up all night <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">cramming</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;Therefore, it is important to sleep well and not to stay up all night cramming for exams.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> for exams.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">따라서 충분히 잠을 자고 시험공부를 벼락치기하느라 밤을 새우지 않는 것이 중요하다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. cram: 벼락치기하다</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;Kermode suggests trying '<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">spaced repetition</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;Kermode suggests trying 'spaced repetition', which means practising at increasing intervals.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>', which means practising at increasing intervals.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">커모드는 복습 간격을 점차 늘려가며 연습하는 '간격 반복 학습'을 시도할 것을 제안한다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. spaced repetition: 간격 반복 학습</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;the <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">hippocampus</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;the hippocampus actually increases in volume&quot;\" aria-label=\"&quot;the hippocampus actually increases in volume&quot; 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button> actually increases in volume&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">해마의 부피가 실제로 증가한다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. hippocampus: 해마</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;...recommends <mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">mnemonics</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;...recommends mnemonics, and specifically acronyms, for revision.&quot;\" aria-label=\"예문 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>, and specifically acronyms, for revision.&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">복습할 때 기억술, 특히 두문자어를 활용하는 방법을 추천한다.</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. mnemonic: 기억술, 암기법, 연상 기호</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n<section class=\"nv-word-section nv-narrative\">\n  <p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-quote nv-ex-en\">&quot;something called ‘<mark class=\"nv-hl nv-hl--soft\">prospective memory</mark><button type=\"button\" class=\"vv-tts-btn\" data-vv-tts=\"&quot;something called ‘prospective memory’&quot;\" aria-label=\"&quot;something called ‘prospective memory’&quot; 영어 발음 듣기\" title=\"발음 듣기\" style=\"margin-left:4px;padding:0;border:0;background:transparent;box-shadow:none;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;vertical-align:baseline;\">🔊</button>’&quot;</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-gloss nv-ex-ko\">'미래기억'이라고 불리는 것</p>\n<p class=\"nv-narrative-text nv-narrative-def\">cf. prospective memory: 미래에 할 일을 기억하는 능력, 미래기억</p>\n  <hr class=\"nv-section-rule\" />\n</section>\n</div>\n<footer class=\"nv-related-links\">\n<p class=\"nv-related-link-line\"><a class=\"nv-related-link nv-related-link--youtube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bIKxLCK2Tso\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">📺</span> 유튜브 보기</a></p>\n<div class=\"board-comments-root nv-related-comments\" data-board-comments-root></div>\n</footer>\n<footer class=\"nv-source\">\n  <p class=\"nv-source-label\">출처</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-text\">The Guardian | How to improve your memory: 10 easy, enjoyable expert tips – from reading a book to getting more sleep | By Sarah Phillips</p>\n  <p class=\"nv-source-link-wrap\"><a class=\"nv-source-link\" href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2026/nov/01/how-to-improve-your-memory-10-easy-enjoyable-expert-tips-from-reading-a-book-to-getting-more-sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">원문 기사 보기</a></p>\n</footer>\n</article>",
